#### 10. Ignored / Disabled Test — `disabledTest` (line 110)

`@Disabled("flaky, fix later")` leaves a test permanently skipped. The reason "flaky, fix later" has no tracking reference.

```java
@Test
@Disabled("flaky, fix later")
void disabledTest() { ... }
```

**Refactor** — either fix the flakiness and re-enable, or link to a tracking issue:

```java
@Disabled("Tracked by JIRA-1234 — intermittent timing failure in CI")
```

**Risk if unfixed:** Dead test code accumulates; the underlying defect is never addressed.

